@startuml
title Grading & Feedback Flow

actor Frontend as FE

rectangle "ApiController.PostUserAnswersAsync" as Controller_Post
rectangle "GradingService.GradeAsync" as Grading
rectangle "IPassageRepository.GetEntityByIdForGradingAsync" as Repo
database "AppDbContext\n(Passages, Questions)" as DB

FE -> Controller_Post: POST /api/passages/submit\n{PassageId, Answers[]}
Controller_Post -> Grading: GradeAsync(PassageSubmissionDto)
Grading -> Repo: GetEntityByIdForGradingAsync(PassageId)
Repo -> DB: Query passage + question minimal fields\n(Id, Position, CorrectChoice, AnswerChoicesCount)
Repo --> Grading: PassageForGradingDto { Questions[] }

Grading -> Grading: Validation
note right
- duplicate answers check
- unknown question ids check
- SelectedAnswer bounds check (uses AnswerChoicesCount)
end note

Grading -> Grading: Scoring
note right
- compare SelectedAnswer to CorrectChoice
- build QuestionResultDto for each question
- accumulate CorrectCount, TotalQuestions
end note

Grading --> Controller_Post: SubmissionFeedbackDto
Controller_Post --> FE: 200 OK + SubmissionFeedbackDto

note left
SubmissionFeedbackDto:
- TotalQuestions
- CorrectCount
- Results: List<QuestionResultDto>
QuestionResultDto:
- QuestionId
- UserAnswer (int?)
- CorrectAnswer (int)
- IsCorrect (bool)
end note

@enduml
